","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/philippmelikidis/aether-motors/commits/79989ea92a99612d5f82148c6500005f3a86051a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-01T09:16:33Z","email":"philipp.melikidis@gmail.com","name":"Philipp Melikidis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-01T09:16:33Z","email":"philipp.melikidis@gmail.com","name":"Philipp Melikidis"},"message":"Fix cart retry logic: distinguish product-not-found (422) from cart-not-found (404)\n\n- CartContext: add initPromiseRef to prevent race conditions between init and addToCart\n- CartContext: withCartRetry now checks error message to only retry on missing carts, not missing products\n- CartContext: addToCart logs non-503 errors for debugging instead of silently swallowing\n- cart.ts: read payload.message (not payload.error) to preserve cart-service error messages\n- cart-service: return 422 for product-not-found (was 404, which confused the retry logic)\n\nThe Docker image was stale with old mock product IDs. After rebuilding, the full retry flow now works:\nif a cart is lost (404), create a new one and retry the operation.","tree":{"sha":"e1bd24eaaee829239e2de590007404d0805c1f2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/philippmelikidis/aether-motors/git/trees/e1bd24eaaee829239e2de590007404d0805c1f2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/philippmelikidis/aether-motors/git/commits/79989ea92a99612d5f82148c6500005f3a86051a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40140537?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philippmelikidis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philippmelikidis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philippmelikidis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/philippmelikidis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/