file base images, OpenSSL/BoringCrypto)\n- Expand Dependency Alerts with ecosystem coverage guidance and binary\n  present/absent evaluation approach\n- Add sub-sections (Linting, FIPS Compatibility, Dependency Alerts) to\n  Static Analysis detailed findings template\n- Remove all remaining forbidden references (security scanning, image\n  scanning, vulnerability thresholds, etc.)\n- Merge Code Quality and Static Analysis key files sections\n- Replace security-oriented gaps/recommendations with FIPS and build\n  integration equivalents\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e386d7ac2c416bd781c9438ba47b16ff58267122","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/e386d7ac2c416bd781c9438ba47b16ff58267122"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/3d311adbf883526a844297fc7f9f223aef2364f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3415105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kami619","id":3415105,"login":"kami619","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTUxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/3d311adbf883526a844297fc7f9f223aef2364f0","node_id":"C_kwDOR06TYtoAKDNkMzExYWRiZjg4MzUyNmE4NDQyOTdmYzdmOWYyMjNhZWYyMzY0ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/f56a1fe8d0a2f6e0d134cba5d91a6ad45a542e79","sha":"f56a1fe8d0a2f6e0d134cba5d91a6ad45a542e79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/f56a1fe8d0a2f6e0d134cba5d91a6ad45a542e79"}],"sha":"3d311adbf883526a844297fc7f9f223aef2364f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/3d311adbf883526a844297fc7f9f223aef2364f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3415105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kami619","id":3415105,"login":"kami619","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTUxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/f56a1fe8d0a2f6e0d134cba5d91a6ad45a542e79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:09:34Z","email":"kakella@redhat.com","name":"Kamesh Akella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-17T08:09:34Z","email":"kakella@redhat.com","name":"Kamesh Akella"},"message":"feat(quality-repo-analysis): restructure to 8 deterministic dimensions\n\nReplace 7-dimension scorecard with 8 explicitly weighted dimensions:\n- Remove Security Practices (Trivy/Snyk/CodeQL/gitleaks — not repo-configurable)\n- Add Static Analysis (linting, FIPS compatibility, dependency alerts, pre-commit)\n- Assign weights to all dimensions (previously Build Integration and Agent Rules were unweighted)\n- Add concrete \"What We Check\" per dimension for deterministic scoring\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1eb747351ca63d314ce7ff801b91f672a03fc6c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/1eb747351ca63d314ce7ff801b91f672a03fc6c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/f56a1fe8d0a2f6e0d134cba5d91a6ad45a542e79","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3415105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kami619","id":3415105,"login":"kami619","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MTUxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kami619","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/f56a1fe8d0a2f6e0d134cba5d91a6ad45a542e79","node_id":"C_kwDOR06TYtoAKGY1NmEx