rpunia@redhat.com","name":"RiyaP-QA"},"message":"Add PyTorch-specific quality analysis skill\nAdds a new skill for analyzing PyTorch/ML framework repos across\n6 ML-specific pillars: Testability, Correctness, Completeness,\nMaintainability, Compatibility, and Performance.\nComplements the generic quality-repo-analysis skill with PyTorch-specific\npatterns (OpInfo, gradcheck, device-agnostic tests, Dynamo/Inductor, etc.).\nReuses existing html_generator.py for dashboard generation.","tree":{"sha":"4e4dd5d9d06d9ec32f96bb68b924f316b1928dcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/4e4dd5d9d06d9ec32f96bb68b924f316b1928dcc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/4065741fdba73bf3e4c375e9cb57edf39d10877a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217712076?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/RiyaP2508","id":217712076,"login":"RiyaP2508","node_id":"U_kgDODPoFzA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RiyaP2508","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/4065741fdba73bf3e4c375e9cb57edf39d10877a","node_id":"C_kwDOR06TYtoA