:29Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T08:54:06Z","email":"33689325+antowaddle@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"feat: add formal Claude Code plugin structure with autocomplete support\n\nAdd plugin metadata and standardized skill frontmatter to enable autocomplete\nfor all skills in Claude Code, following the pattern from fege/test-plan#29.\n\nChanges:\n- Add .claude-plugin/plugin.json with metadata and dependencies\n- Add pyproject.toml for Python package management (v0.1.0)\n- Add requirements.txt and requirements-dev.txt for dependencies\n- Standardize all skill SKILL.md files with proper frontmatter\n- Update README.md with plugin installation and usage info\n- Add plugin badges and enhanced documentation\n\nSkills with autocomplete (6 total):\n- risk-assessment\n- historical-bug-coverage\n- quality-repo-analysis\n- konflux-build-simulator\n- test-rules-generator\n- workflow-diagram-generator\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b37fab2391096d63c6b88c21cc3af5ae554f8de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/0b37fab2391096d63c6b88c21cc3af5ae554f8de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/0beb390ed4bb4834bfc19e5f7a5164311c1de6b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","orga