owaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/c35eb069f1640ee1c1ec747648be64ef0bceace9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T16:03:34Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-29T07:59:40Z","email":"33689325+antowaddle@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"fix: address all PR review feedback for historical-bug-coverage skill\n\nSecurity & Stability Fixes:\n- Fix token leakage in test_skill.py (show length only, not prefix)\n- Fix hard-coded file path in test_skill.py (use os.getcwd())\n- Fix XSS vulnerabilities in report_generator.py (escape all user input)\n- Fix IndexError in report_generator.py (guard bugs[0] access)\n- Fix silent error handling (log file read and git errors)\n\nCode Quality:\n- Document magic numbers in scoring logic (85/75/50/30 thresholds)\n- Add rationale for entity count requirements (4/3/2/1)\n\nBest Practice Alignment:\n- Add YAML frontmatter to SKILL.md (gerund form name + description)\n- Add references section linking to instructions.md and modules\n- Trim SKILL.md from 291 to 168 lines (push detail to references)\n- Add TOC to instructions.md (required for 100+ line files)\n- Add workflow checklist to instructions.md\n- Document dependencies (Python 3.8+, optional openpyxl)\n- Create evaluations.json with 3 structured test scenarios\n\nVerified: Analysis runs successfully on ODH Dashboard (70 bugs, 1235 tests, 82KB report)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7862a37691902b3c3eaf5b2230a9ef9a7c8ab9d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/7862a37691902b3c3eaf5b2230a9ef9a7c8ab9d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/c35eb069f1640ee1c1ec747648be64ef0bc