/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/c82c5cbd38ab1b0689b5d2217d7c49d9a0368b5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-28T16:10:26Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-28T16:10:26Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"fix: address all PR review feedback for risk-assessment skill\n\nAddresses comments from PR #21:\n- https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/pull/21#issuecomment-4336844454\n- https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/pull/21#issuecomment-4336851763\n\n## Changes\n\n### 1. Extract inline bash to utility scripts (52% reduction)\n- Created 6 utility scripts: parse_args.sh, extract_pr.sh, load_context.sh,\n  verify_outputs.sh, run_decision.sh, report_results.sh\n- Reduced SKILL.md from 322 to 153 lines\n- Follows best practice: \"utility scripts save tokens\"\n\n### 2. Fix false dependency documentation\n- Added requirements.txt with PyYAML>=6.0 and requests>=2.31.0\n- Updated README to document actual dependencies\n- Added dependency check in SKILL.md Step 0\n\n### 3. Fix misleading configuration docs\n- README now correctly documents DEFAULT_REPOS in search_cross_repo_refs.py\n- Removed non-existent CONTEXT_REPOS bash array pattern\n\n### 4. Fix risk score mismatch after K8s escalation\n- Modified aggregate_risk_score() to return breakdown dict\n- Risk breakdown table now shows actual computed values (including crossrepo_risk=90)\n- Previously hardcoded 70/30, now dynamically reflects K8s escalation\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1818780fba3a5a83f8a79dc3bd439e73d2b9aaa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/1818780fba3a5a83f8a79dc3bd439e73d2b9aaa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/c82c5cbd38ab1b0689b5d2217d7c49d9a0368b5a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/c82c5cbd38ab1b0689b5d2217d7c49d9a0368b5a","node_id":"C_kwDOR06TYtoAKGM4MmM1Y2JkMzhhYjFiMDY4OWI1ZDIyMTdkN2M0OWQ5YTAzNjhiNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/867b884208ef4a2bf82cd3679b56a6032b870daa","sha":"867b884208ef4a2bf82cd3679b56a6032b870daa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/867b884208ef4a2bf82cd3679b56a6032b870daa"}],"sha":"c