red{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/8e35624877e4a861e6272653019790b51d260943/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-27T11:19:41Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T11:19:41Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"Add WebSocket and API content-type regression detection\n\nAdds validation to catch fastify v4→v5 upgrade regressions that\nrequired revert in PR #7387.\n\nChanges:\n- Test PATCH with application/merge-patch+json content-type\n- Test PATCH with application/json-patch+json content-type\n- Detect 415 Unsupported Media Type errors (Fastify 5 regression)\n- Test WebSocket endpoint connections\n- Detect pod crashes from WebSocket attempts\n- Monitor container stability after WebSocket test\n\nThis catches regressions from PR #6727 (fastify upgrade):\n1. WebSocket crash - @fastify/websocket v8→v11 removed SocketStream\n   - Non-admin users trigger 403 on WS upgrade\n   - Unhandled error event causes pod crash (exit 1 or OOMKill 137)\n\n2. 415 errors on PATCH operations - Fastify 5 content-type parser\n   - Rejects application/merge-patch+json\n   - Rejects application/json-patch+json\n   - Breaks 28+ operations: notebooks, model serving, pipelines, RBAC,\n     hardware profiles, admin config\n\nAddresses issues that required full revert in PR #7387.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73d8b937f51d978dfa10af24459bb6eff15267ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/73d8b937f51d978dfa10af24459bb6eff15267ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/8e35624877e4a861e6272653019790b51d260943","ve