own formatting\n  (**Overall Score:** in addition to plain \"Overall Score:\")\n\nTested with real quality reports - all scores now extract correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"779a4cbd26d84abeb8c1bc511613bd34fc92e67d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/779a4cbd26d84abeb8c1bc511613bd34fc92e67d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/03ad27986001a4c1412f00ed368e1cfd362c74dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/03ad27986001a4c1412f00ed368e1cfd362c74dc","node_id":"C_kwDOR06TYtoAKDAzYWQyNzk4NjAwMWE0YzE0MTJmMDBlZDM2OGUxY2ZkMzYyYzc0ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/4c52db81f1532bb1b9a4b5cb8bf3a11b3c91a3e5","sha":"4c52db81f1532bb1b9a4b5cb8bf3a11b3c91a3e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/4c52db81f1532bb1b9a4b5cb8bf3a11b3c91a3e5"}],"sha":"03ad27986001a4c1412f00ed368e1cfd362c74dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/03ad27986001a4c1412f00ed368e1cfd362c74dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/4c52db81f1532bb1b9a4b5cb8bf3a11b3c91a3e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T09:41:43Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T09:41:43Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"Address PR review feedback for aggregate_quality_reports.py\n\nImplemented all 5 review comments from @fege:\n\n1. **Fix score pattern regex to avoid false matches** (Line 59)\n   - Updated regex to only match tables in Quality Scorecard section\n   - Added explicit section boundary detection to prevent matching\n     tables in recommendations or history sections\n\n2. **Use removesuffix() instead of replace() for .git removal** (Line 185)\n   - Changed `.replace(''.git'', '''')` to `.removesuffix(''.git'')`\n   - Safer approach using Python 3.9+ string method\n   - Prevents incorrect matches like ''legit'' → ''le''\n\n3. **Extract analyzed_date from report frontmatter** (Line 103)\n   - Now parses YAML frontmatter to get actual analysis date\n   - Falls back to current time only if not in frontmatter\n   - More accurate reporting of when analysis was performed\n\n4. **Match reports by URL from frontmatter, not filename** (Line 277)\n   - Completely rewrote process_reports() to be filename-agnostic\n   - Reads ALL .md files and extracts repo URL from YAML frontmatter\n   - Matches reports to architecture-context repos by URL\n   - Solves the \"big assumption\" about filename patterns\n   - Added extract_repo_url_from_report() method for robust matching\n\n5. **Use html.escape() for all HTML interpolated values** (Lines 595-604)\n   - Added html.escape() for repo names, URLs, and source types\n   - Prevents HTML injection vulnerabilities\n   - Imported escape from html module\n\nAdditional improvements:\n- Added YAML parsing with graceful fallback if pyyaml unavailable\n- Better error messages when reports can''t be matched\n- More robust handling of edge cases in URL matching\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dff88f1c8d2468e93e61bc134b8df2e4fb75d95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/dff88f1c8d2468e93e61bc134b8df2e4fb75d95f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/4c52db81f1532bb1b9a4b5cb8bf3a11b3c91a3e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.