ing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/70356590d9a04c522c922cedb7284c7693da9015/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T10:40:05Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T10:40:05Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"Add dependency pre-flight checks and uv run documentation\n\nUpdates to ensure PyYAML is available before running the skill:\n\n- Add Step 0: Pre-flight Checks to instructions.md\n  - Check PyYAML availability before starting analysis\n  - Provide clear installation instructions using uv\n  - Block proceeding until dependencies confirmed\n\n- Update README_HTML.md with uv run examples\n  - Recommend `uv run --with pyyaml` as primary method\n  - Show alternative global pip install method\n  - Update all code examples to use uv\n\n- Update instructions.md Step 10 to use uv run\n  - Change from bare python3 to `uv run --with pyyaml python3`\n  - Ensures dependencies available without global installation\n\nThis prevents the fallback parser issue where reports were generated\nwith missing data when PyYAML wasn''t installed.","tree":{"sha":"67c385de5c9075c30caededc620c0a0f6dae813b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/67c385de5c9075c30caededc620c0a0f6dae813b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/70356590d9a04c522c922cedb7284c7693da9015","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/70356590d9a04c522c922cedb7284c7693da9015","node_id":"C_kwDOR06TYtoAKDcwMzU2NTkwZDlhMDRjNTIyYzkyMmNlZGI3Mjg0Yzc2OTNkYTkwMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/c5636bc4573aaa3d02b15e3475ff803acd6c4413","sha":"c5636bc4573aaa3d02b15e3475ff803acd6c4413","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/c5636bc4573aaa3d02b15e3475ff803acd6c4413"}],"sha":"70356590d9a04c522c922cedb7284c7693da9015","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/70356590d9a04c522c922cedb7284c7693da9015"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/c5636bc4573aaa3d02b15e3475ff803acd6c4413/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T10:31:58Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T10:31:58Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"Fix simple YAML parser for systems without PyYAML\n\nThe fallback parser (parse_yaml_simple) had bugs that prevented it from\ncorrectly parsing nested structures in YAML frontmatter. This caused HTML\ngeneration to fail when PyYAML was not installed.\n\nFixes:\n- Rewrite parse_yaml_simple with proper indentation-based stack management\n- Fix list item parsing to handle nested dict properties (title, impact, severity, effort)\n- Fix nested dict-of-lists structures (recommendations with priority_0, priority_1, priority_2)\n- Add clear warning message when PyYAML is not installed, with installation instructions\n\nNow the fallback parser correctly handles:\n- scorecard: list of dicts with dimension, score, status\n- critical_gaps: list of dicts with title, impact, severity, effort\n- quick_wins: list of dicts with title, effort, impact\n- recommendations: dict with priority_N keys containing lists\n\nTested without PyYAML - all sections now populate correctly in HTML output.","tree":{"sha":"06912551a387dc38843d7d89825d0cc016ed6ac8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/06912551a387dc38843d7d89825d0cc016ed6ac8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/c5636bc4573aaa3d02b15e3475ff803acd6c4413","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/c5636bc4573aaa3d02b15e3475ff803acd6c4413","node_id":"C_kwDOR06TYtoAKGM1NjM2YmM0NTczYWFhM2QwMmIxNWUzNDc1ZmY4MDNhY2Q2YzQ0MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/b968a3531a9b75c21c2a069d3c81623bd2c3875d","sha":"b968a3531a9b75c21c2a069d3c81623bd2c3875d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/b968a3531a9b75c21c2a069d3c81623bd2c3875d"}],"sha":"c5636bc4573aaa3d02b15e3475ff803acd6c4413","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/c5636bc4573aaa3d02b15e3475ff803acd6c4413"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/b968a3531a9b75c21c2a069d3c81623bd2c3875d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T08:22:33Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T08:22:33Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"Make HTML generation automatic in quality-repo-analysis skill\n\n- Update Step 10 in instructions.md to automatically generate HTML after markdown\n- Update SKILL.md to document automatic HTML generation\n- Add instructions to open HTML in browser automatically\n- Emphasize YAML frontmatter requirement for reliable parsing\n- Both markdown and HTML reports now created automatically","tree":{"sha":"8165621904d4fdbd3736f5fc464566ca4443b403","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/8165621904d4fdbd3736f5fc464566ca4443b403"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/b968a3531a9b75c21c2a069d3c81623bd2c3875d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/b968a3531a9b75c21c2a069d3c81623bd2c3875d","node_id":"C_kwDOR06TYtoAKGI5NjhhMzUzMWE5Yjc1YzIxYzJhMDY5ZDNjODE2MjNiZDJjMzg3NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commit/87e3ad67b8737e5b7d4f8d78f982100ed63baf82","sha":"87e3ad67b8737e5b7d4f8d78f982100ed63baf82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/87e3ad67b8737e5b7d4f8d78f982100ed63baf82"}],"sha":"b968a3531a9b75c21c2a069d3c81623bd2c3875d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/b968a3531a9b75c21c2a069d3c81623bd2c3875d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/87e3ad67b8737e5b7d4f8d78f982100ed63baf82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T08:11:58Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T08:11:58Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"Add YAML frontmatter support for robust HTML generation\n\nAddresses the issue raised by fege where LLM-generated markdown has\nvariable structure, causing regex parser to miss sections.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **HTML Generator (html_generator.py)**\n   - Add YAML frontmatter extraction with PyYAML (preferred) or fallback parser\n   - Parse structured data from frontmatter: scorecard, critical_gaps, quick_wins, recommendations\n   - Maintain backward compatibility with regex parsing for old reports\n   - Add frontmatter detection and graceful degradation\n\n2. **Skill Instructions (instructions.md)**\n   - Update output format specification to require YAML frontmatter\n   - Provide complete frontmatter schema example\n   - Document all required fields and structure\n\n3. **Documentation (README_HTML.md)**\n   - Document YAML frontmatter format (recommended)\n   - Document legacy regex parsing (backward compat)\n   - Add PyYAML requirement and installation instructions\n\n4. **Dependencies (requirements.txt)**\n   - Add pyyaml>=6.0 requirement\n\n**Testing:**\n- ✅ Frontmatter parsing: Extracts all sections correctly\n- ✅ Backward compatibility: Falls back to regex for old reports\n- ✅ Score accuracy: 7.8 from frontmatter, 7.5 from regex (both correct)\n- ✅ Missing sections fixed: Critical Gaps, Quick Wins, Recommendations now populate\n\n**Impact:**\nSolves the deterministic parser vs. variable LLM output problem by using\nstructured YAML frontmatter instead of brittle regex on prose.","tree":{"sha":"9640b57f05cea2e21e5f92965dd2172b1dff6c4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/9640b57f05cea2e21e5f92965dd2172b1dff6c4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/87e3ad67b8737e5b7d4f8d78f982100ed63baf82","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organiz