thony Coughlin"},"message":"Add interactive HTML report generator to quality-repo-analysis skill\n\nEnhances the quality-repo-analysis skill with an HTML report generator\nthat converts markdown analysis reports into interactive, visually-rich\nweb pages.\n\nFeatures:\n- Animated circular score visualization with color-coded indicators\n- Interactive scorecard with hover effects\n- Collapsible sections for improved navigation\n- Color-coded severity badges (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW)\n- Responsive design for desktop and mobile\n- Zero dependencies - pure HTML/CSS/JS\n- Self-contained single file output\n\nNew files:\n- html_generator.py: Python script to convert markdown to HTML\n- README_HTML.md: Comprehensive documentation for the generator\n- sample_report.md: Example markdown report for demonstration\n- sample_output.html: Example generated HTML report\n\nUpdated files:\n- SKILL.md: Added HTML report generation documentation\n- instructions.md: Added Step 10 for HTML report generation\n\nUsage:\n  python3 html_generator.py input.md output.html","tree":{"sha":"b0b20b03a6f4e1f4d5fe80b524c1b5c77605f164","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/b0b20b03a6f4e1f4d5fe80b524c1b5c77605f164"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/353feb9d60cec83923ea340c49f04da711dce1f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https: