llowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/commits/8dc9584ab8ffd6b36dab86d48eb3c4e1a4edeed2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-07T11:15:59Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T08:13:21Z","email":"acoughli@redhat.com","name":"Anthony Coughlin"},"message":"Address PR review feedback for fingerprinting system\n\nFixes antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team#3 review comments:\n\n1. Fixed directory structure - moved all files from nested .claude/.claude/skills/\n   to correct .claude/skills/ path (rebase issue). Preserved all skill directories:\n   - konflux-build-simulator/\n   - quality-repo-analysis/\n   - test-rules-generator/\n   - shared/ (fingerprint and jira utilities)\n\n2. Renamed DEFAULT_PROJECT to DEFAULT_JIRA_PROJECT for clarity\n\n3. Removed unused RFE-specific functions from jira_utils.py:\n   - strip_metadata() - RFE YAML/metadata stripping\n   - text_to_adf_codeblock() - RFE archival comments\n   - archival_comment_adf() - RFE archival helpers\n   - adf_to_markdown() - bidirectional conversion (unused)\n   - create_issue_link() - RFE/STRAT linking\n   - get_transitions() - workflow transitions\n   - do_transition() - status transitions\n\n   Kept only functions needed for fingerprinting workflow.\n\n4. Fixed critical label accumulation issue - added remove_labels() function\n   and logic to remove opposite status labels (success/failure) before adding\n   new ones. This prevents ambiguous state where both success and failure\n   labels exist simultaneously.\n\nChanges:\n- .claude/skills/shared/jira_utils.py: 651 → 421 lines (-230 lines, -35%)\n- .claude/skills/shared/fingerprint_utils.py: Updated imports and label logic\n- All skill directories preserved and moved to correct location\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7c83e195a607ad313d5b5dd3e4d24ff17af8bae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/trees/f7c83e195a607ad313d5b5dd3e4d24ff17af8bae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/antowaddle/Red-Hat-Quality-Tiger-Team/git/commits/8dc9584ab8ffd6b36dab86d48eb3c4e1a4edeed2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33689325?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/antowaddle","id":33689325,"login":"antowaddle","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjg5MzI1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antowaddle","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"h