.githubusercontent.com/u/125774532?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nol4lej","id":125774532,"login":"nol4lej","node_id":"U_kgDOB38qxA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nol4lej","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LitMDX/litmdx/commits/812ab33babde644403a472888836c1f0a3bfa151/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:32:06Z","email":"nome.ahumada@outlook.com","name":"nol4lej"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-18T18:32:06Z","email":"nome.ahumada@outlook.com","name":"nol4lej"},"message":"feat(cli): AgentChat widget, docs index, route resolver, dotenv — v0.4.0\n\nTemplate\n- Add AgentChat.tsx — full streaming chat widget (no external deps):\n  SSE consumer, custom Markdown renderer (headings, code, tables,\n  callouts, inline), session persistence, mobile-responsive layout\n- Add agent-chat.css — complete widget styles with dark/light tokens,\n  callout variants (note/tip/warning/danger), code highlight, animations\n- Wire AgentChat into app.tsx (conditional on agent.enabled config)\n\nSearch / indexer\n- Add docs-index.ts — DocsIndex builder: walks MDX files, strips\n  frontmatter/JSX via mdx-parser, emits /docs-index.json at build time\n- Add mdx-parser.ts — strips frontmatter, import lines, JSX components,\n  collapses blank lines (shared logic with @litmdx/agent rawToMarkdown)\n- Add route-resolver.ts — maps filesystem paths to URL routes respecting\n  the LitMDX routing conventions (index, slug, nested)\n- Refactor pagefind-index.ts — integrate DocsIndex builder, remove\n  duplicated parsing logic\n\nVite integration\n- Add docs-index-middleware.ts — serves /docs-index.json in dev mode\n  (hot-reloaded on MDX file changes)\n- Update vite/config.ts — register docs-index middleware, expose\n  agent config to the template via virtual module\n- Update user-config.ts — add agent options (enabled, provider, etc.)\n- Fix html-fallback.ts — handle edge cases in SPA fallback routing\n\nCLI\n- Add utils/dotenv.ts — load .env / .env.local before starting the\n  Vite server (Node 18 compat, no dotenv dependency)\n- Wire dotenv loader in dev.ts and build.ts\n\nTests (new + reorganized)\n- tests/commands/build.test.ts — build command unit tests\n- tests/commands/init.test.ts — init/scaffold tests\n- tests/commands/run.test.ts — renamed from commands.test.ts\n- tests/search/docs-index.test.ts — DocsIndex builder tests\n- tests/search/mdx-parser.test.ts — MDX stripping tests\n- tests/search/route-resolver.test.ts — route mapping tests\n- tests/search/pagefind-index.test.ts — updated pagefind tests\n- tests/utils/dotenv.test.ts — dotenv loader tests\n- tests/vite/user-config.test.ts — user config validation tests\n- tests/vite/plugins/docs-index-middleware.test.ts — middleware tests\n- tests/vite/plugins/html-fallback.test.ts — fallback handler tests\n- Reorganize: sitemap/, ssg/, prepare/, template/, vite/resolve/ subdirs\n- Add tsconfig.test.json + vitest.config.ts reporter config\n\nDependencies\n- Add @litmdx/agent 0.1.0 (new peer — chat widget target)\n- Pin @litmdx/core to workspace:* (local workspace resolution)\n- Bump version 0.3.2 → 0.4.0","tree":{"sha":"10ad837009ef13d4cde393ff8512916b2405f1ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LitMDX/litmdx/git/trees/10ad837009ef13d4cde393ff8512916b2405f1ed"},"url":"h