position of their index.mdx; fall back to minimum\n  child position when no index exists (helpers.ts)\n- Render sub-groups recursively in SidebarGroup.tsx with hasActiveItem() helper\n- Add 46 sidebar tests covering nesting, group ordering, and collapsed state\n\nCustom components (opt-in system)\n- Add generated-components.ts: writes .litmdx/user-components.ts at build/dev time\n- Add user-components-watcher.ts: hot-reloads when src/components/index.ts changes\n- Add template/src/generated/user-components.ts with lazy-loaded default export\n- Wire into template/src/components/index.ts via opt-in import\n\nDocs structure\n- Create docs/home/features/customization/ sub-group (index, custom-components, tailwindcss)\n- Remove duplicate features/custom-components.mdx and features/tailwindcss.mdx\n- Rewrite components.mdx, custom-components.mdx, tailwindcss.mdx with real examples\n- Add sidebar groups section to routing.mdx (2-level limit documented)\n- Update frontmatter.mdx: group ordering behaviour, sidebar_position on index.mdx,\n  nesting limit callout, group position without index.mdx\n\nBug fixes\n- Fix init.ts logo/favicon paths: .svg → .png (matching actual template/public/ assets)\n- Fix broken /features/custom-components link in components.mdx (moved to /customization/)\n- Fix create-litmdx test: favicon path expectation updated to match generated config\n\nREADME\n- Add nested sidebar groups, custom components and multi-section mode to features list\n- Add Sidebar ordering and Custom components sections with examples\n- Update config example with logo.light/dark using .png paths","tree":{"sha":"d6425a6dbfd72d68bdbf142bceb55f4c1baf3d0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LitMDX/litmdx/git/trees/d6425a6dbfd72d68bdbf142bceb55f4c1baf3d0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LitMDX/litmdx/git/commits/3f822588162e4d77d4ec9dd1a3eef36a921bd4c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"av