mitchavis@gmail.com","name":"Mitch Avis"},"message":"build: hold code examples to the full house ruff standard\n\nPython blocks in skills were linted with 23 rules disabled and never format-checked. The\nchecker now also requires ruff format to leave each block unchanged, and the snippet config\ndisables only what a fragment cannot satisfy (module docstring, package, names from the prose,\ntop-level await/return). Test and fixture blocks are linted as files under tests/, getting the\nsame per-file exemptions as house repos (S101, PLR2004, D). Standalone .py files in skill\nreferences join the repo''s own ruff scope.","tree":{"sha":"83fecc9d568785cdb5a9ecb4465e831b7c13fd3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/trees/83fecc9d568785cdb5a9ecb4465e831b7c13fd3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/commits/0d38b427ad84b2b5b7a6ca6b724d310cb1fbaad7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://g