"date":"2026-10-03T08:37:18Z","email":"mitchavis@gmail.com","name":"Mitch Avis"},"message":"fix(skill-creator): keep eval workspaces out of the skills repo\n\nWorkspaces were created next to the skill under evaluation, which is inside this git repo, so\ntranscripts and benchmark output cluttered git status and risked being committed. They now go\nunder ~/.cache/skill-evals/, keeping the -workspace suffix the viewer relies on, and\n*-workspace/ is gitignored as a backstop.","tree":{"sha":"434e08ebf21c249be7b4c94c810767c3f170399e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/trees/434e08ebf21c249be7b4c94c810767c3f170399e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/commits/2c94664bc9fae2322ec8f922bdf7aff664faf566","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commit/2c94664bc9fae2322ec8f922bdf7aff664faf566","node_id":"C_kwDOR1JTGtoAKDJjOTQ2NjRiYzlmYWUyMzIyZWM4ZjkyMmJkZjd