ate":"2026-10-03T08:20:24Z","email":"mitchavis@gmail.com","name":"Mitch Avis"},"message":"fix(rust): align examples and rules with the deny-level lint config\n\nThe #[expect] example named exhaustive_structs, a lint the workspace never enables, so the\nexpectation went unfulfilled and failed -D warnings; it now uses struct_excessive_bools\n(verified with nightly clippy) and explains the rule. unsafe_code is forbid everywhere, with the\nreal per-crate path for FFI, since forbid can''t be lifted by attributes. unwrap and expect are\ntests-only, matching the deny lints. rust-async: tokio::task::spawn_blocking and a fan-out\nexample that no longer uses a moved Vec. rust-testing: std::hint::black_box.","tree":{"sha":"f728065a359c490e1f763f14a0d15264f3fb1c0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/trees/f728065a359c490e1f763f14a0d15264f3fb1c0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/commits/f20ac593b7217b3c10a7b5e00799e96ce0f4dec2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commit/f20ac593b7217b3c10a7b5e00799e96ce0f4dec2","node_id":"C_kwDOR1JTGtoAKGYyMGFjNTkzYjcyMTdiM2MxMGE3YjVlMDA3OTllOTZjZTBmNGRlYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commit/c2246792f80f97dc521f95e3bbe43f603305150d","sha":"c2246792f80f97dc521f95e3bbe43f603305150d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commits/c2246792f80f97dc521f95e3bbe43f603305150d"}],"sha":"f20ac593b7217b3c10a7b5e00799e96ce0f4dec2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commits/f20ac593b7217b3c10a7b5e00799e96ce0f4dec2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commits/c2246792f80f97dc521f95e3bbe43f603305150d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T08:19:46Z","email":"mitchavis@gmail.com","name":"Mitch Avis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T08:19:46Z","email":"mitchavis@gmail.com","name":"Mitch Avis"},"message":"fix: correct mermaid erd semantics and repair broken markdown\n\nmermaid described ERD lines backwards; per the Mermaid docs ''--'' is identifying and ''..'' is\nnon-identifying. The ERD reference also listed an invalid ''}{'' cardinality and had two list items\nmerged by a past re-wrap. observability''s reference-map table split at an unescaped ES|QL pipe.\nmarkdown-documentation''s mermaid reference had been re-wrapped into invalid diagrams with\nmismatched fences and duplicated the mermaid skill, so it is removed and the table points there.","tree":{"sha":"c402268c1f164d8d3853078685baffce809941eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/trees/c402268c1f164d8d3853078685baffce809941eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/commits/c2246792f80f97dc521f95e3bbe43f603305150d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commit/c2246792f80f97dc521f95e3bbe43f603305150d","node_id":"C_kwDOR1JTGtoAKGMyMjQ2NzkyZjgwZjk3ZGM1MjFmOTVlM2JiZTQzZjYwMzMwNTE1MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commit/18952169927d08a1ea2f78960cbac4e4ab640198","sha":"18952169927d08a1ea2f78960cbac4e4ab640198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commits/18952169927d08a1ea2f78960cbac4e4ab640198"}],"sha":"c2246792f80f97dc521f95e3bbe43f603305150d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commits/c2246792f80f97dc521f95e3bbe43f603305150d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commits/18952169927d08a1ea2f78960cbac4e4ab640198/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T08:19:14Z","email":"mitchavis@gmail.com","name":"Mitch Avis"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T08:19:21Z","email":"mitchavis@gmail.com","name":"Mitch Avis"},"message":"fix(generating-custom-instructions): fix claude facts, go agents-first\n\nThe format reference said Claude Code loads skills from ~/.agents/skills (it reads only\n.claude/skills paths), ranked personal instructions above repo ones (Claude Code concatenates;\nnothing overrides), omitted that AGENTS.md is read only when no CLAUDE.md exists, and showed a\ndescription field that rule files ignore.\n\nThe skill now generates AGENTS.md as the single source of truth with a thin @AGENTS.md CLAUDE.md\nand paths-scoped .claude/rules, with Copilot files opt-in. It no longer forces a docstring\nstability rule into every file, models plain-volume rules with reasons, and its inventory\ncommand finds CLAUDE.local.md and rule files while skipping vendored directories.","tree":{"sha":"e196e209271dd8d3a4a44a0ccc7392956f39feed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/trees/e196e209271dd8d3a4a44a0ccc7392956f39feed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/commits/18952169927d08a1ea2f78960cbac4e4ab640198","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis/