ver, and its comments guidance\n(\"avoid comments\", mandated comments as a smell) conflicted with the\nstanding rule that every module, class, and function has a docstring.\n\nRemove the skill, its README row and source-table entries, and the\nrelated-skill links in code-review and test-driven-development. The\nacknowledgments paragraph no longer states a skill count, which had\nalready drifted.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the clean-code skill no longer exists; drop any\ninstruction files or settings that name it.","tree":{"sha":"115d8bf6438aeba86734f95d1c9559b53abfe104","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/trees/115d8bf6438aeba86734f95d1c9559b53abfe104"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/commits/be8aaaace9faf520ebdb0b1e6d08302b801cb9b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis/agent-skills/commit/be8aaaace9faf520ebdb0b1e6d08302b801cb9b5","node_id":"C_kwDOR1JTGtoAKGJ