nself-contained subagent brief, the concurrency and worktree limits,\nand the two-attempt failure stop, and adds a rule to verify subagent\nresults before relaying them.\n\nThe old version triggered on almost any multi-part request and pushed\nparallel subagents for it, which costs a cold-start session per\nsubagent and conflicts with hosts that spawn subagents only on\nrequest. It also carried a routing table that restated the skill\nlisting, a copy of the gate commands that had drifted from the global\nstandards (100% coverage, repo-wide markdownlint), and a confidence\nprotocol that proceeded without waiting for an answer. Those sections\nare dropped. The README row now describes the narrower scope.","tree":{"sha":"64fc24f108a8aa049b243830ec792f06b43b1995","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/trees/64fc24f108a8aa049b243830ec792f06b43b1995"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/commits/bdd6194410ba6f1cd4f8a93d56240a7f9ab9c2d3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h