e":"docs: lead skill descriptions with when-to-use triggers\n\nRewrite the description of 23 language and file-type skills so each\nstarts with the moment to invoke it (\"Use before writing or editing\nany .py file...\") instead of a topic summary (\"Core Python development\nguide covering...\").\n\nClaude Code picks skills by matching the listing descriptions against\nthe task at hand. Topic-style descriptions rarely matched, so these\nskills went unused; trigger-first wording names the files and actions\nthat should invoke each skill. Only the description field changes; the\nskill bodies and other frontmatter are untouched, and every\ndescription stays under the 1024-character Agent Skills limit.","tree":{"sha":"5baebb8b36f984b37d21d3709b6bf62a684bce7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/trees/5baebb8b36f984b37d21d3709b6bf62a684bce7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mitch-avis/agent-skills/git/commits/6ce5e28f649bb7d87a68c42c3b916a6c71737978","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111894662?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mitch-avis","id":111894662,"login":"mitch-avis","node_id":"U_kgDOBqtghg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mitch-avis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https