:"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/linkwell/commits/964f4a9b27a30e1f4e7266b84b0d1e80f36c3ba3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T21:11:34Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T21:11:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: ValidateGraph excludes self-links from orphan detection (#57)\n\nThe orphan detection loop built the inbound set by marking every\nl.Href as inbound regardless of source, so a page whose only\n\"inbound\" link was a self-link was incorrectly considered\nnon-orphaned. Skip links where source == l.Href so self-links no\nlonger count as inbound.\n\nCloses #51","tree":{"sha":"526b6633c2aa3108e27e168abfa2171a93b6d225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/linkwell/git/trees/526b6633c2aa3108e27e168abfa2171a93b6d225"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/linkwell/git/commits/964f4a9b27a30e1f4e7266b84b0d1e80f36c3ba3","verification":{"payload":"tree 526b6633c2aa3108e27e168abfa2171a93b6d225\nparent a1cab2331fcc47f061b9bfa9cdf63f20a134e8ae\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775769094 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775769094 -0500\n\nfix: ValidateGraph excludes self-links from orphan detection (#57)\n\nThe orphan detection loop built the inbound set by marking every\nl.Href as inbound regardless of source, so a page whose only\n\"inbound\" link was a self-link was incorrectly considered\nnon-orphaned. Skip links where source == l.Href so self-links no\nlonger count as inbound.\n\nCloses #51","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2BYGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABGEQAK9TKZgoF9f3TW6PkO+et5H4\nc/uoAtaW7VrVutoKzGUVbigSTXAd4qfaz/AKZ+8hA21Pi7uo4Epi9GdKqyJmE+sT\nFg7T80K77LExpuoMEyJPaYd9ilV05ZM195CQTDuFhwY6Jfg033XEQ679vK+7Ji9j\nEUQsbQrBYe+N2zT0q3XJE4SfJ4de48CXUeW5lEP2H3jmo45PtHqikCn6Y9w8eYjH\nXMTSMKyQOPiA1DFx2GItujFe/IziamHdWlZ4NurvI3SxDJRanqrpDKV3QhETF/yg\nyrBO3QER+8GON5//Oq0yXxoh3WF/QVgOF9GMYetmBSsvACILCfOUpXKZ4Z2nDXSd\nXxorIQv7KeZpdojNv/u0DNSR62UqsjIHB5oMSkuDKMO2eLzrvGDKl/jhTZ3hKgfs\n6Z2gOksCYRe7v7Ch5uDlGOPZveiPSmtjQ8Xmthp5XNfnA2vvc0x2RXgyH22EFhY2\njo2gswteED9ECNM02N8Zkvlb5lGVuouWts/vFVXgqbT5HsqsZjYKYi05/w18GujC\nsSNAuyJ9nmB7DPQxTZK/cprq4UpNhVOqXf0srdeYzg5HAecf+cxL6R9mW6zf3TGn\nRz1h5NPIjTaSLniG2wHnMXotkb65w1YAZ3csqfMEgBYNEYUVSnuEHMjPzxPr/oke\ngHHtRfa/p4GdAw6GQWje\n=noaW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-09T21:11:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/linkwell/commit/964f4a9b27a30e1f4e7266b84b0d1e80f36c3ba3","node_id":"C_kwDOR1SOvNoAKDk2NGY0YTliMjdhMzBlMWY0ZTcyNjZiODRiMGQxZTgwZjM2YzNiYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose/linkwell/commit/a1cab2331fcc47f061b9bfa9cdf63f20a134e8ae","sha":"a1cab2331fcc47f061b9bfa9cdf63f20a134e8ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/linkwell/commits/a1cab2331fcc47f061b9bfa9cdf63f20a134e8ae"}],"sha":"964f4a9b27a30e1f4e7266b84b0d1e80f36c3ba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/linkwell/commits/964f4a9b27a30e1f4e7266b84b0d1e80f36c3ba3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21010072?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/catgoose","id":21010072,"login":"catgoose","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDEwMDcy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/catgoose","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/linkwell/commits/a1cab2331fcc47f061b9bfa9cdf63f20a134e8ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-09T21:08:36Z","email":"21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Meow Honk"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-09T21:08:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Hubs() returns only exact spokes, no parent fallback (#56)\n\nHubs() previously used LinksFor() to resolve each hub center''s spokes,\nwhich walks up the path hierarchy when the exact path has no registered\nlinks. This meant a hub registered at a child path with no exact related\nlinks would silently inherit an ancestor''s related links as its spokes.\n\nSwitch to linksForExact() so Hubs() never returns parent fallback links.\n\nCloses #53","tree":{"sha":"fd732b14f8c18f6b8dd21c3ca5a47464e3b01130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/linkwell/git/trees/fd732b14f8c18f6b8dd21c3ca5a47464e3b01130"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/catgoose/linkwell/git/commits/a1cab2331fcc47f061b9bfa9cdf63f20a134e8ae","verification":{"payload":"tree fd732b14f8c18f6b8dd21c3ca5a47464e3b01130\nparent 3c507a0df73c412ea395f6bc20d3e6c0e2e4b4c9\nauthor Meow Honk <21010072+catgoose@users.noreply.github.com> 1775768916 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775768916 -0500\n\nfix: Hubs() returns only exact spokes, no parent fallback (#56)\n\nHubs() previously used LinksFor() to resolve each hub center''s spokes,\nwhich walks up the path hierarchy when the exact path has no registered\nlinks. This meant a hub registered at a child path with no exact related\nlinks would silently inherit an ancestor''s related links as its spokes.\n\nSwitch to linksForExact() so Hubs() never returns parent fallback links.\n\nCloses #53","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp2BVUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuVEQAB3TJhs8eEY8oWbPQx7D9oiA\n5TaPn/cDn9U6veKtoIZfmdG9WaFegH0bSLSu2WcZLdSH783y1+qyEAQv/wwebTKe\nzzt6w62z6BeOLbtoeGQhRB2+k2nhKww48+ifUNlIwujjf1Pm0R7+0wQrfyFf4ru2\nGAHWh3cZGK2HifnYSEtb6XRLkX58+5GYh+e2XRLODW0xhN7Rg0JxSUObGbfllJzK\n8s09LMsxxomNEMeIp6WK2jROfFNsxU1EbPsqOKp04x8rbIKZ1ky2PIFZYddxhq/I\nKFRmkpkh5D/3k1l7xCvN9Eu86wAGxDaZ29j4Ik3v2AmhQ7lhHccdUPfQ7AOChrc4\nUbOXez1fBqXb7KXLa/5Kc+j4FWh5RaKENorq07byo0n0MJjF+QI/nGT5UARlDvu8\nYLq+I16XXdqRHT9hYjt11oBLjBbpOvLSHFPZzWfLuS5aOt4obyVLzEV7up0564I7\nseozJk4MQgAetlRjo2or7WC