rl":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/commits/43134b68b4f325b1156ce22beb2d08a81c03d023/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T17:13:01Z","email":"christava@microsoft.com","name":"Chris Tava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T17:13:01Z","email":"christava@microsoft.com","name":"Chris Tava"},"message":"refactor(monorepo): adopt 4-stack layout and underscore-prefix support dirs\n\nReorganize azure-healthcare-digital-quality monorepo into the new stack\nlayout (providers/, submitters/, receivers/, platform/) and rename\ntop-level support directories to use an underscore prefix so they\nsort/group separately from the stacks.\n\nRenames (top-level)\n  data/      -> _data/\n  docs/      -> _docs/\n  evals/     -> _evals/\n  images/    -> _images/\n  measures/  -> _measures/\n  scripts/   -> _scripts/\n  tests/     -> _tests/\n\nStack moves\n  backend/        -> submitters/backend/\n  orchestrator/   -> submitters/orchestrator/\n  frontend/       -> submitters/frontend/\n  infra/          -> submitters/_infra/\n  azure.yaml      -> submitters/azure.yaml\n\nPath rewrites\n  Updated all tracked source, docs, CI, scripts, hooks, and config\n  references to the new paths (.gitignore, README.md, SECURITY.md,\n  copilot-instructions.md, ci.yml, docker-compose.yml, _scripts/*,\n  submitters/_infra/hooks/*, submitters/backend/src/*,\n  submitters/orchestrator/src/*, submitters/frontend/src/*).\n\n  Notably, submitters/backend/src/main.py sample-data resolver now\n  prefers _data/ at the repo root with legacy data/ fallbacks.\n\nValidation\n  - forbidden_fields_lint.py: Phase 0 skeleton -- OK\n  - sync-duplicates.sh:       Phase 0 skeleton -- OK\n  - docker compose config:    validates clean\n  - submitters/orchestrator:  :8000/health healthy\n  - submitters/backend:       :5000/ Hello World\n  - submitters/frontend:      :5173/ HTTP 200\n\n  Cosmos firewall blocks the local IP (pre-existing infra config);\n  backend correctly falls back to file-backed sample services.\n\nStacks providers/, receivers/, platform/ contain only requirements.txt\nplaceholders -- service scaffolding deferred.","tree":{"sha":"5a2e8045b9681c919b05b92ab453bd1e674a7698","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/trees/5a2e8045b9681c919b05b92ab453bd1e674a7698"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/commits/43134b68b4f325b1156ce22beb2d08a81c03d023","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172321005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctava-msft","id":172321005,"login":"ctava-msft","node_id":"U_kgDOCkVo7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/commit/43134b68b4f325b1156ce22beb2d08a81c03d023","node_id":"C_kwDOR1ZKNNoAKDQzMTM0YjY4YjRmMzI1YjExNTZjZTIyYmViMmQwOGE4MWMwM2QwMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/commit/cbd3f93969f64f72415567aa24abe0714662cb39","sha":"cbd3f93969f64f72415567aa24abe0714662cb39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/commits/cbd3f93969f64f72415567aa24abe0714662cb39"}],"sha":"43134b68b4f325b1156ce22beb2d08a81c03d023","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/commits/43134b68b4f325b1156ce22beb2d08a81c03d023"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172321005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctava-msft","id":172321005,"login":"ctava-msft","node_id":"U_kgDOCkVo7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/commits/cbd3f93969f64f72415567aa24abe0714662cb39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T23:19:09Z","email":"christava@microsoft.com","name":"Chris Tava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T23:19:09Z","email":"christava@microsoft.com","name":"Chris Tava"},"message":"fix(orchestrator): SDK-driven CQL executor with tz-naive Measurement Period override\n\nReplaces the legacy regex evaluator with a pure ms-cql-sdk driven executor (translate -> ELM -> InvocationToolkit) for native CQL measure evaluation.\n\nAlso strips tzinfo from the Measurement Period override before constructing the SDK Interval. The SDK runtime parses FHIR period strings into naive datetimes, so an aware-vs-naive comparison inside retrieves was silently caught and zeroed out every retrieve, flipping CMS122v11 populations (IP/Den false, Num true via the ''Has No HbA1c Test Performed'' branch). Verified end-to-end with p-cms122-001: IP=true, Den=true, Num=false, controlled=true.","tree":{"sha":"56a9151501cdcf71fcf966ca6d413dc8497e6685","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/trees/56a9151501cdcf71fcf966ca6d413dc8497e6685"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/commits/cbd3f93969f64f72415567aa24abe0714662cb39","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172321005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctava-msft","id":172321005,"login":"ctava-msft","node_id":"U_kgDOCkVo7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctav