html_url":"https://github.com/ctava-msft","id":172321005,"login":"ctava-msft","node_id":"U_kgDOCkVo7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/commits/d3158600f94592fa27329ae51cc8324b12ce543a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:58:45Z","email":"christava@microsoft.com","name":"Chris Tava"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-17T01:58:45Z","email":"christava@microsoft.com","name":"Chris Tava"},"message":"docs(research): rewrite main.tex to reframe as deterministic agent with graded tasks\n\nDrop chat-surface language throughout. Replace the conversational UI framing with an agent-task architecture in which the deterministic CQL engine produces four counts, the agent picks one of K=4 response templates per measure-cohort task, and three LLM judges plus a routing reward and a hallucination penalty grade every rendered response on a single scalar axis in [-1,+1]. Reframe the conclusion''s contribution ordering from feature-shipping order to per-task execution priority: the reward contract executes first, the four-template action set bounds the failure surface second, the contextual policy is optional and executes third. Remove all em dashes, fix broken ''a agent'' grammar, replace POST /chat/answer with the FastAPI task endpoint, and tighten the abstract, contributions list, and section 5 orthogonality argument.","tree":{"sha":"d0adee2fb709ffb4c63c82387be14e1bc6d6c855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-heal