.txt) to pick up ContextualSoftmaxPolicy and the new shaping fields.\n\n* frontend: rename cohort panel label ''Surveillance'' -> ''Agentic Surveillance'' (panel id ''surveillance'' preserved to keep backend routing stable).\n\n* docs/research: new IEEE paper main.tex pre-registering the RL experiment with reward as primary contribution, four-template control surface orthogonal to reward, contextual softmax policy as secondary, plus pilot four-population sweep and scale-out H1/H2/H3 hypotheses.\n\n* docs: add AGENTS_LEARNING_DESIGN.md replacing AGENTS_AGENT_LIGHTNING_DESIGN.md; refresh azure-agents-control-plane diagram.\n\n* purge Agent Lightning scaffolding: delete orchestrator/src/lightning/*, lightning_tools.py, infra/app/lightning-cosmos.bicep, docs/AGENTS_AGENT_LIGHTNING_*.md, scripts/{build_and_train,deploy_finetuned_model,label_episodes,list_episodes,monitor_training,run_finetuning}.py, tests/test_agent_lightning.py.\n\n* structural: move CQL measure files orchestrator/src/measures/* -> measures/ at repo root; move orchestrator/Dockerfile -> Dockerfile.orchestrator at repo root with Dockerfile.orchestrator.dockerignore; add infra/app/learning-cosmos.bicep.\n\n* scripts: add smoke_test_rl_localhost.py, migrate_cosmos_dbs.py, snapshot_mcpdb.py, drop_cosmos_dbs.ps1 to support local RL smoke and cosmos lifecycle ops.","tree":{"sha":"7d136bb98b1891a0810543d0dcf5661d4703b71e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/trees/7d136bb98b1891a0810543d0dcf5661d4703b71e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/commits/cead5676629bb00a1c660785887354524898a055","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172321005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-ms