 dq namespace (service is named ''orchestrator'')\n\n- Live backend pods inherited the old hardcoded default http://mcp-agents.mcp-agents.svc.cluster.local from a prior image build, producing NameResolutionError for every /api/patient/{id}/measure call\n\n- Add explicit DIGITAL_QUALITY_ORCHESTRATOR_BASE_URL env in backend/k8s/deployment.yaml so future rollouts cannot regress\n\n- Verified: orchestrator service reachable from backend pod at http://orchestrator.dq.svc.cluster.local:80/health (returns 200 healthy)","tree":{"sha":"5c6686ff95803b460b2b6db946223f7414a3a185","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/trees/5c6686ff95803b460b2b6db946223f7414a3a185"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/commits/a68cfca931560689957fa2c2cd9bdd28a408478d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172321005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctava-msft","id":172321005,"login":"ctava-msft","node_id":"U_kgDOCkVo7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-qua