s Tava"},"message":"feat(orchestrator): integrate ms-cql-sdk 0.2.1 for CQL->ELM parsing\n\n- Add cql_sdk import guarded by _SDK_AVAILABLE so the executor still runs if the SDK is missing\n\n- Extend CQLLibrary dataclass with optional elm (Library) and elm_json fields, fully backward compatible\n\n- CQLExecutor.evaluate() now calls _enrich_with_sdk() on every parse to attach a fully resolved ELM Library\n\n- _enrich_with_sdk catches SDK errors at debug level so evaluation never regresses on bad input\n\n- Bump both Dockerfile copies to python:3.12-slim because ms-cql-sdk requires Python >=3.12\n\n- Verified end-to-end on CMS122v11, CMS165v9, ePC02 fixtures: SDK parses 16/17/19 definitions and CMS165 still evaluates in_numerator=True, controlled=True","tree":{"sha":"fd80b84510c61fb1b64d118a4398e178cf72b294","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/trees/fd80b84510c61fb1b64d118a4398e178cf72b294"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ctava-msft/azure-healthcare-digital-quality-platform/git/commits/a2fb63d0838082067677a8389f72935bdaf09a11","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172321005?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctava-msft","id":172321005,"login":"ctava-msft","node_id":"U_kgDOCkVo7Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctava-msft/starred{/owner}{/