:{"author":{"date":"2026-04-02T07:38:27Z","email":"123@gmail.com","name":"kechuanjia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-02T07:38:27Z","email":"123@gmail.com","name":"kechuanjia"},"message":"fix: enable progressive streaming output with frameYield\n\nRoot cause: for-await loop runs on microtask queue (Promises), and\nbrowsers only paint between macrotasks. All stream chunks were dispatched\nwithout yielding to the browser''s rendering pipeline.\n\nFix: add frameYield() (setTimeout(0)) after each chunk dispatch to let\nthe browser paint. Remove useDeferredValue from MessageList.","tree":{"sha":"d1840833d3cbc86faf826675c60a147a61cf43aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Orange-001/micro-frontend-demo/git/trees/d1840833d3cbc86faf826675c60a147a61cf43aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Orange-001/micro-frontend-demo/git/commits/1184b4f25f06404fabf1a788b38bc2931dbededb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6297453?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sps123","id":6297453,"login":"sps123","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTc0NTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sps123","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Orange-001/micro-frontend-demo/commit/1184b4f2