@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"test: update schema_per_tenant tenancy tests for fail-closed bind\n\nThe #29 fail-closed change adds a to_regnamespace existence probe before each\nsearch_path bind, so the shipped tests/unit/test_tenancy.py mock session must\nreturn a result with .scalar() and the binders now emit two statements (probe +\nset_config). Update _FakeSession + reindex the assertions to the set_config\n(now last), and add a test that an unprovisioned tenant gets an empty\nsearch_path (fail closed). Fixes the matrix-verify(py_schema_token_claim) CI lane.","tree":{"sha":"0ae5580f95c3c44668ac2ae2246b60eaa8c9e1f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/0ae5580f95c3c44668ac2ae2246b60eaa8c9e1f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/b7e77ff379d0443a29413120da0e61ac3dc3b520","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/b7e77ff379d0443a29413120da0e61ac3dc3b520","node_id":"C_k