657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/5b62e4b93f5ec8e7797eb05d27e03156731b73a9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:32:38Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:32:38Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(codegen,gatekeeper): ts-ast newline guard + non-idempotent retry + import\n\n#26: ts_ast.inject_ts lacked python_ast''s _ensure_trailing_newline guard, so a\nBEGIN sentinel injected after an anchor on the file''s last line (no trailing\nnewline) fused onto the anchor line and corrupted it (the anchor was then\nswallowed on re-run). Port the guard.\n\n#10: gatekeeper exchange_code + refresh_tokens were wrapped in @with_retry; a\nReadTimeout after Keycloak issued tokens replays the single-use authorization\ncode (invalid_grant 400) -> login fails. Drop @with_retry from these\nnon-idempotent OAuth token operations.\n\n#28: routes.py used session_fp on _pop_auth_state''s reject branches but never\nimported it -> NameError (500) instead of a graceful 400 on a corrupt/expired\nauth-state envelope. Add the import.","tree":{"sha":"c78737a63bdc10e5c59dad586952f3a390bd8240","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/c78737a63bdc10e5c59dad586952f3a390bd8240"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/5b62e4b93f5ec8e7797eb05d27e03156731b73a9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signat