":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/e3fea97f6bab1020779f66fe3238fd75d6d8956a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:28:44Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:28:44Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(frontend): stale-run guard + canvas null/empty safety\n\n#7: Svelte + Flutter chat clients reduced stream events straight into the shared\nsnapshot with no generation guard, so resetThread/editAndResend mid-stream let a\nsuperseded run''s late events re-add ghost messages + flip isRunning (only Vue\nwas protected). Port Vue''s runGeneration counter: capture per run, early-return\nfrom onEvent/settle/catch when superseded, bump in resetThread/editAndResend\n(Flutter: the await-for return also cancels the stream).\n\n#25: Svelte canvas DataTable threw on a null/heterogeneous row (row[col.key] on\nnull) and CanvasPane had no boundary. Filter null rows + null-safe cell access +\nwrap the dynamic component in <svelte:boundary> (mirrors Vue''s CanvasError).\n\n#27: Flutter DataTable built with zero columns (rows present, no derivable cols)\ntripped Material''s assert(columns.isNotEmpty) -> guard with a placeholder.\n\nFlutter/svelte runtime not available here (no dart/flutter; svelte vitest needs\napp deps); forge-CI gate is tests/test_frontend_chat_canvas_guards.py + the fix\nmirrors the tested Vue implementation.","tree":{"sha":"b5805e702d7799837b1a3ad6e04effc43830d1d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/b5805e702d7799837b1a3ad6e04effc43830d1d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/e3fea97f6bab1020779f66fe3238fd75d6d8956a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/e3fea97f6bab1020779f66fe3238fd75d6d8956a","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKGUzZmVhOTdmNmJhYjEwMjA3NzlmNjZmZTMyMzhmZDc1ZDZkODk1NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/0f420d1ed667a445f32181867d7e8e112bc4a34a","sha":"0f420d1ed667a445f32181867d7e8e112bc4a34a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/0f420d1ed667a445f32181867d7e8e112bc4a34a"}],"sha":"e3fea97f6bab1020779f66fe3238fd75d6d8956a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/e3fea97f6bab1020779f66fe3238fd75d6d8956a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/0f420d1ed667a445f32181867d7e8e112bc4a34a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:27:57Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:27:57Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(runtime): rust connect-info + pagination 422, node trustProxy\n\n#8: rust served a bare Router, so ConnectInfo<SocketAddr> was never populated\nand the rate limiter keyed every request on ''anonymous'' (one global bucket =\nDoS). Serve with into_make_service_with_connect_info::<SocketAddr>().\n\n#13: rust list bound unvalidated negative ?limit/?skip into SQL LIMIT/OFFSET ->\nPostgres error -> HTTP 500. Reject out-of-range with AppError::Validation (422),\nmatching Python 422 / Node 400.\n\n#14: node @fastify/rate-limit keyed on req.ip without trustProxy, so behind the\ndocumented Traefik front every client collapsed onto the proxy IP / one bucket.\nSet trustProxy=''uniquelocal'' + a per-tenant/IP keyGenerator (mirrors Python).\n\nRust changes verified via cargo build (matrix verify lane, green).","tree":{"sha":"afb341aa502f7d46ca27a3573b4188e4176f1c7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/afb341aa502f7d46ca27a3573b4188e4176f1c7a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/0f420d1ed667a445f32181867d7e8e112bc4a34a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/0f420d1ed667a445f32181867d7e8e112bc4a34a","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKDBmNDIwZDFlZDY2N2E0NDVmMzIxODE4NjdkN2U4ZTExMmJjNGEzNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/0498af7d8eecd9cc75351d92aea8c6d40bfa018f","sha":"0498af7d8eecd9cc75351d92aea8c6d40bfa018f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/0498af7d8eecd9cc75351d92aea8c6d40bfa018f"}],"sha":"0f420d1ed667a445f32181867d7e8e112bc4a34a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/0f420d1ed667a445f32181867d7e8e112bc4a34a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"