s{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/b2403b25de0bdeb5b1efd03cd44cef46a2e5279d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:02:29Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T06:02:29Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(config): reject silently-broken backend/db/port combos\n\nSix validation gaps that passed config.validate() then crashed generation,\nshipped a broken stack, or silently no-op''d:\n\n- database.mode=none on a Node/Rust backend (Python-only stripper) -> hard-fail (#4)\n- connectors.enabled lacked requires_database -> stateless+connectors crashed mid-apply (#9)\n- agent.mode lacked Python-only gating -> Node/Rust-only resolved to a no-op agent stack (#16)\n- backend name colliding with a reserved infra service -> duplicate compose key (#19)\n- distinct names deriving the same db_name (my-svc/my_svc) -> silent shared DB (#20)\n- keycloak_port colliding with a fixed infra host port -> silent overwrite, compose ''port allocated'' (#21)","tree":{"sha":"3648d66b4185f26e7bbcaa1b496fcd1bcce3ec1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/3648d66b4185f26e7bbcaa1b496fcd1bcce3ec1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/b2403b25de0bdeb5b1efd03cd44cef46a2e5279d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signatu