:"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/08b1a36563337d4603cd542712f8d438234630f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:53:06Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:53:06Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(multitenancy): token_claim resolves post-auth tenant context\n\nThe tenant resolver read request.state.identity for token_claim, but in the\ngenerate-mode default auth runs as a FastAPI route dependency (get_current_user),\nnot an outer middleware — so identity is unset when TenantRLSMiddleware runs\n(it precedes route deps) and token_claim always resolved None. The inject.yaml\n+ docstrings falsely claimed an auth middleware bound identity first. (Isolation\nstill held via the account-scoped GUC the AsyncUnitOfWork binds independently.)\n\nFall back to forge_core''s authoritative customer_id_context ContextVar (the\nverified tenant bound post-auth) so token_claim resolves wherever the tenant is\nin scope, and correct the false ordering comments. Mirrored into the\nschema_per_tenant resolver (kept byte-identical by test_schema_resolver_code_matches_rls).","tree":{"sha":"fd8ba363be7b1691f47ddbf95b0601ff48c93cee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/fd8ba363be7b1691f47ddbf95b0601ff48c93cee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/08b1a36563337d4603cd542712f8d438234630f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/08b1a36563337d4603cd542712f8d438234630f8","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKDA4YjFhMzY1NjMzMzdkNDYwM2NkNTQyNzEyZjhkNDM4MjM0NjMwZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/eb300472136ea93a7426985a675969d326626715","sha":"eb300472136ea93a7426985a675969d326626715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/eb300472136ea93a7426985a675969d326626715"}],"sha":"08b1a36563337d4603cd542712f8d438234630f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/08b1a36563337d4603cd542712f8d438234630f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/eb300472136ea93a7426985a675969d326626715/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:45:11Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:45:11Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(multitenancy): RLS-cover tenant feature tables under shared_rls\n\nshared_rls only enabled RLS on items/audit_logs; feature models that subclass\nTenantMixin (conversations, conversation_messages, conversation_tool_calls,\nchat_files, rag_document_chunks, rag_pg_document_chunks, webhooks) carry\ncustomer_id but had no RLS policy, so a query omitting the customer_id\npredicate leaked cross-tenant there. Add a late, existence-guarded RLS\nmigration (0099, runs after every feature table-creation migration via the\nrechainer''s numeric ordering; to_regclass-guarded so disabled features are\nskipped) that applies the same ENABLE+FORCE+tenant-policy. Adds a drift guard\nasserting every TenantMixin feature table is RLS-covered.","tree":{"sha":"5ac63050669ebc83ba49838d066a7de3f999e543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/5ac63050669ebc83ba49838d066a7de3f999e543"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/eb300472136ea93a7426985a675969d326626715","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/eb300472136ea93a7426985a675969d326626715","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKGViMzAwNDcyMTM2ZWE5M2E3NDI2OTg1YTY3NTk2OWQzMjY2MjY3MTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/03636c3d4c4eb154e5edbbbf5d89d67d503a0c59","sha":"03636c3d4c4eb154e5edbbbf5d89d67d503a0c59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/03636c3d4c4eb154e5edbbbf5d89d67d503a0c59"}],"sha":"eb300472136ea93a7426985a675969d326626715","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/eb300472136ea93a7426985a675969d326626715"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/03636c3d4c4eb154e5edbbbf5d89d67d503a0c59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:35:56Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:35:56Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(sync): binary-aware record-side hashing\n\nprovenance.sha256_of CRLF-normalized unconditionally (no binary detection)\nwhile the three-way merge used the binary-aware sha256_of_file, so a binary\nasset containing the bytes 0x0D 0x0A recorded a different baseline digest than\nthe merge side computed — flagging an untouched binary fragment as a spurious\n.forge-merge.bin conflict on a legitimate bump. Delegate sha256_of to\nsha256_of_file so record-side and merge-side hashing are identical (text:\nLF-normalized; binary: raw bytes). Aligns migrate_adopt_baseline seeding too.","tree":{"sha":"e1fa5f03fdf5019207d9bf08ab757c580a6d8973","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/e1fa5f03fdf5019207d9bf08ab757c580a6d8973"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/03636c3d4c4eb154e5edbbbf5d89d67d503a0c59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/03636c3d4c4eb154e5edbbbf5d89d67d503a0c59","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKDAzNjM2YzNkNGM0ZWIxNTRlNWVkYmJiZjVkODlkNjdkNTAzYTBjNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/b5c9aeec1b623df54995eb8591fc3cf3d1570646","sha":"b5c9aeec1b623df54995eb8591fc3cf3d1570646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/b5c9aeec1b623df54995eb8591fc3cf3d1570646"}],"sha":"03636c3d4c4eb154e5edbbbf5d89d67d503a0c59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/03636c3d4c4eb154e5edbbbf5d89d67d503a0c59"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/b5c9aeec1b623df54995eb8591fc3cf3d1570646/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:33:29Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:33:29Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(update): count only real new file conflicts\n\nThe update summary''s file_conflicts rglob''d every .forge-merge sidecar,\ncounting two non-conflict populations: presurface edit-trail sidecars\n(written for user-modified base-template files that Copier merged cleanly)\nand stale sidecars from prior runs (presurface won''t clobber a pre-existing\none). So file_conflicts could be >0 on a run that produced zero new conflicts.\nSnapshot pre-existing sidecars before the run and subtract them + the\npresurfaced set, counting only genuinely-new conflict sidecars.","tree":{"sha":"61b0fc4df771c20bfd54898482c6f8c0290498d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/61b0fc4df771c20bfd54898482c6f8c0290498d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/b5c9aeec1b623df54995eb8591fc3cf3d1570646","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/b5c9aeec1b623df54995eb8591fc3cf3d1570646","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKGI1YzlhZWVjMWI2MjNkZjU0OTk1ZWI4NTkxZmMzY2YzZDE1NzA2NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/f2ab6f5371978e02a5968db3d86cac7e9984bd88","sha":"f2ab6f5371978e02a5968db3d86cac7e9984bd88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/f2ab6f5371978e02a5968db3d86cac7e9984bd88"}],"sha":"b5c9aeec1b623df54995eb8591fc3cf3d1570646","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/b5c9aeec1b623df54995eb8591fc3cf3d1570646"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/f2ab6f5371978e02a5968db3d86cac7e9984bd88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:30:47Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:30:47Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(update): plan preview renders .jinja fragment paths\n\nforge --plan-update walked fragment files/ trees with no jinja/ephemeral\nawareness: it kept the .jinja suffix (so the destination it checked never\nexisted on disk -> phantom action=''new''), never produced the rendered file''s\nreal decision, hashed the raw template instead of the rendered body, and\nsurfaced ephemeral build artefacts (__pycache__/*.pyc). Mirror the applier\n(appliers/files.py::copy_files): skip _is_ephemeral_path, strip the .jinja\nsuffix, and hash the rendered body via the same FragmentContext-built render\ncontext. Adds tests/test_plan_update_jinja.py.","tree":{"sha":"97320a2a8dfb35a0d49b6a13578e1b1e2a70b10e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/97320a2a8dfb35a0d49b6a13578e1b1e2a70b10e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/f2ab6f5371978e02a5968db3d86cac7e9984bd88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/f2ab6f5371978e02a5968db3d86cac7e9984bd88","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKGYyYWI2ZjUzNzE5NzhlMDJhNTk2OGRiM2Q4NmNhYzdlOTk4NGJkODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/2960e7d27decd3d9559d3e445cee31994311f435","sha":"2960e7d27decd3d9559d3e445cee31994311f435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/2960e7d27decd3d9559d3e445cee31994311f435"}],"sha":"f2ab6f5371978e02a5968db3d86cac7e9984bd88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/f2ab6f5371978e02a5968db3d86cac7e9984bd88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/2960e7d27decd3d9559d3e445cee31994311f435/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:12:33Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T05:12:33Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(auth): node JWKS cache stale-serve fallback\n\nThe Node JWKSCache delegated to jose''s createRemoteJWKSet, which has no\nstale-on-error fallback: staleMaxSeconds was validated + documented but\nnever honoured, so a JWKS/IdP outage longer than the refresh interval\nrejected otherwise-valid tokens whose kid was already cached, while the\nRust + Python caches kept serving last-known-good. Reimplement the cache\nto own fetch + cache (jose createLocalJWKSet for key matching) with\nrefresh-after-lifespan, stale-serve within staleMaxSeconds, and in-flight\ndedup, mirroring rust jwks.rs. fetchImpl is injectable for tests.\n\nAdds test/jwks_stale_serve.test.ts (injectable fetch + fake clock).","tree":{"sha":"4d2891b31d39156918d39996e1d9077ed1c963ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/4d2891b31d39156918d39996e1d9077ed1c963ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/2960e7d27decd3d9559d3e445cee31994311f435","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/2960e7d27decd3d9559d3e445cee31994311f435","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKDI5NjBlN2QyN2RlY2QzZDk1NTlkM2U0NDVjZWUzMTk5NDMxMWY0MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/2b6cfc8ba4c5597579768fba4d9185ac48ca3c7e","sha":"2b6cfc8ba4c5597579768fba4d9185ac48ca3c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/2b6cfc8ba4c5597579768fba4d9185ac48ca3c7e"}],"sha":"2960e7d27decd3d9559d3e445cee31994311f435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/2960e7d27decd3d9559d3e445cee31994311f435"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/2b6cfc8ba4c5597579768fba4d9185ac48ca3c7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T20:44:45Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T20:44:45Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(auth): validate nbf in rust auth guard\n\njsonwebtoken''s Validation defaults validate_nbf=false, so the rust SDK\nsilently accepted a token whose nbf (not-before) was in the future, while\nPython (PyJWT) and Node (jose) reject it. Set validation.validate_nbf=true\nso the ImmatureSignature -> InvalidToken mapping fires. Adds parity scenario\nreject_token_not_yet_valid (red on Rust only, green after).","tree":{"sha":"2521db58c49462c72c6a079805b1bdbcb616c6b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/2521db58c49462c72c6a079805b1bdbcb616c6b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/2b6cfc8ba4c5597579768fba4d9185ac48ca3c7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/2b6cfc8ba4c5597579768fba4d9185ac48ca3c7e","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKDJiNmNmYzhiYTRjNTU5NzU3OTc2OGZiYTRkOTE4NWFjNDhjYTNjN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/a3c8d3efc232d42909b2369d32f607a9baa39b95","sha":"a3c8d3efc232d42909b2369d32f607a9baa39b95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/a3c8d3efc232d42909b2369d32f607a9baa39b95"}],"sha":"2b6cfc8ba4c5597579768fba4d9185ac48ca3c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/2b6cfc8ba4c5597579768fba4d9185ac48ca3c7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/a3c8d3efc232d42909b2369d32f607a9baa39b95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T20:42:32Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T20:42:32Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Catalin Chifor"},"message":"fix(auth): mark node/rust home routes public\n\nThe welcome (/api/v1/) and service-info (/api/v1/info) endpoints are\ndocumented as unauthenticated, but were absent from the Node\nDEFAULT_EXCLUDED_PATHS and Rust EXCLUDED_PATHS skip-lists. Node/Rust\nenforce auth via a global hard-reject middleware, so with auth enabled\nthese documented-public endpoints 401''d (Python soft-passes + per-route\ndeps, so its home stayed public). Add the home paths to both skip-lists.","tree":{"sha":"4705ebf2cfe499293410d4ca8d2432868a6752eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/4705ebf2cfe499293410d4ca8d2432868a6752eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/a3c8d3efc232d42909b2369d32f607a9baa39b95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"h