d}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/762059dd57bd62c9ee828c5eb52f06360b418751/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T07:28:06Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Constantin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T07:28:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: add operator + observability runbooks (#276)\n\nEvery generated python/node/rust backend now ships OPERATIONS.md (config\norder, migrations/advisory-lock, graceful shutdown, health) and\nOBSERVABILITY.md (otel env vars, RED metrics, Prometheus/Grafana, logging).\nPreviously only tenant-management-service had a HARDENING.md. Golden\nsnapshots regenerated to include the new files.\n\nRefs #258","tree":{"sha":"b427e37a61a5c8799a80d2eed1081a132ccd8da0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/b427e37a61a5c8799a80d2eed1081a132ccd8da0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/762059dd57bd62c9ee828c5eb52f06360b418751","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/762059dd57bd62c9ee828c5eb52f06360b418751","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKDc2MjA1OWRkNTdiZDYyYzllZTgyOGM1ZWI1MmYwNjM2MGI0MTg3NTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/1d6a21e5af5eba81c6a5d44047882e8b41443776","sha":"1d6a21e5af5eba81c6a5d44047882e8b41443776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/1d6a21e5af5eba81c6a5d44047882e8b41443776"}],"sha":"762059dd57bd62c9ee828c5eb52f06360b418751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/762059dd57bd62c9ee828c5eb52f06360b418751"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/1d6a21e5af5eba81c6a5d44047882e8b41443776/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T07:27:31Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Constantin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T07:27:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: #258 engine/sync/CI hardening cluster (#275)\n\n* perf(sync): cache forge.toml on read-only verbs\n\nverify/resolve/accept/reapply now install manifest_cache_scope like\nupdate/harvest, so repeated forge.toml reads (accept''s per-block-candidate\nbaseline lookups especially) parse the manifest once per invocation.\n\nRefs #258\n\n* test(fuzz): fuzz over --platform presets\n\nResolve every preset deterministically + a hypothesis pass over presets\nwith perturbed options, so a broken preset can''t ship unnoticed.\n\nRefs #258\n\n* ci(nightly): name failing scenarios in issue\n\nThe notify job now downloads the per-scenario matrix-status artifacts and\nsplices a ''Failing scenarios'' table (scenario / lane / error detail) into\nthe auto-filed issue, instead of only a per-lane pass/fail grid. Parsing\nlives in a stdlib-only, unit-tested script.\n\nRefs #258\n\n* docs: add mutmut known-survivors log\n\nCreate the structured known-survivors file docs/mutation-testing.md\nreferenced but never shipped, and make the reference a resolvable link.\n\nRefs #258\n\n* test(docs): add doc-truth CI gate\n\nMechanical doc-claim validation: version/python/registry badges, relative\nlinks resolve, documented forge CLI flags exist. Wired into the lint job.\nFixes real drift it caught: forge migrate --only/--skip and --plan-migrate\nin UPGRADING/OPERATIONAL_RUNBOOK were never valid flags (canonical is\n--migrate --migrate-only/--migrate-skip).\n\nRefs #258\n\n* test: assert real --dry-run flag in UPGRADING doc\n\ntest_upgrading_md_has_1_2_section pinned ''forge --plan-migrate'', a flag\nthat never existed — the same drift the new doc-truth gate caught. Assert\nthe real dry-run path (--dry-run) instead, matching the corrected\nUPGRADING.md (forge --migrate --migrate-only <name> --dry-run).\n\nRefs #258","tree":{"sha":"5e365aff81c0cd2752966ab855ba583d88b6ba59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/5e365aff81c0cd2752966ab855ba583d88b6ba59"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/1d6a21e5af5eba81c6a5d44047882e8b41443776","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/1d6a21e5af5eba81c6a5d44047882e8b41443776","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKDFkNmEyMWU1YWY1ZWJhODFjNmE1ZDQ0MDQ3ODgyZThiNDE0NDM3NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/0447ebd0a2fd5dd596733d77b95323488ed5a554","sha":"0447ebd0a2fd5dd596733d77b95323488ed5a554","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/0447ebd0a2fd5dd596733d77b95323488ed5a554"}],"sha":"1d6a21e5af5eba81c6a5d44047882e8b41443776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/1d6a21e5af5eba81c6a5d44047882e8b41443776"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/0447ebd0a2fd5dd596733d77b95323488ed5a554/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T19:25:03Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Constantin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T19:25:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: forge update crashes on stateless/headless projects (#260) (#274)\n\n* fix(config): gate layer sub-fields by mode\n\nfrom_legacy_options forwarded database.engine and frontend.api_target.*\ninto the typed config unconditionally. The option registry stamps those\nas blanket defaults regardless of mode, so a database.mode=none /\nfrontend.mode=none manifest carried fields that DatabaseNone /\nFrontendNone forbid (extra=\"forbid\"), crashing `forge update` with a\npydantic ValidationError (the failing nightly update lane).\n\nGate each sub-field on the effective layer mode, mirroring the\nalready mode-aware to_legacy_options. This also repairs update for\nalready-generated stateless projects on disk.\n\nRefs #260\n\n* fix(generator): omit dead layer defaults from manifest\n\nStop persisting mode-inapplicable layer sub-fields (database.engine when\ndatabase.mode=none, frontend.api_target.* when frontend.mode=none) into\nnew forge.toml manifests. Done before the origin map is built so no\norphaned origin entries survive.\n\nKeeps generated manifests honest and update-safe; generate/external\nmanifests are byte-identical.\n\nRefs #260","tree":{"sha":"91007dd57a89c7fd0af7621312a1e3919b1b17dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/91007dd57a89c7fd0af7621312a1e3919b1b17dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/0447ebd0a2fd5dd596733d77b95323488ed5a554","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/co