ev-dependencies group across 1 directory with 2 updates (#266)\n\nUpdates the requirements on [pytest](https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest) and [ruff](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff) to permit the latest version.\n\nUpdates `pytest` to 9.1.0\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/blob/main/CHANGELOG.rst)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/compare/9.0.3...9.1.0)\n\nUpdates `ruff` to 0.15.17\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/astral-sh/ruff/compare/0.15.16...0.15.17)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: pytest\n  dependency-version: 9.1.0\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  dependency-group: dev-dependencies\n- dependency-name: ruff\n  dependency-version: 0.15.17\n  dependency-type: direct:development\n  dependency-group: dev-dependencies\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"8d5a15b67af444c5d99de3fe46f69631e049b072","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/8d5a15b67af444c5d99de3fe46f69631e049b072"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/5fb4b4a36f30caf2b19761b9f4ca6e201a506dbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/5fb4b4a36f30caf2b19761b9f4ca6e201a506dbe","node_id":"C_kwDOR12LHtoAKDVmYjRiNGEzNmYzMGNhZjJiMTk3NjFiOWY0Y2E2ZTIwMWE1MDZkYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor/forge/commit/82803bbf4f81bbc4c44ec8ab037cc00a4efb12d9","sha":"82803bbf4f81bbc4c44ec8ab037cc00a4efb12d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/82803bbf4f81bbc4c44ec8ab037cc00a4efb12d9"}],"sha":"5fb4b4a36f30caf2b19761b9f4ca6e201a506dbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/5fb4b4a36f30caf2b19761b9f4ca6e201a506dbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13657847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cchifor","id":13657847,"login":"cchifor","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU3ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cchifor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/commits/82803bbf4f81bbc4c44ec8ab037cc00a4efb12d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:09:38Z","email":"chifor@gmail.com","name":"Constantin Chifor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-16T16:09:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump ag-ui client+core to 0.0.57 (#273)\n\n* chore(deps): bump ag-ui client+core to 0.0.57\n\nSupersedes the split dependabot PRs #271 (@ag-ui/client) and #272\n(@ag-ui/core): those bump one canvas package.json each, but\ntests/test_ag_ui_pin_consistency.py requires every consumer to match the\nsingle-source-of-truth constants in forge/codegen/event_union.py, and\n@ag-ui client/core ship in lockstep. Bump both constants and all three\nin-tree canvas packages (canvas-vue, canvas-svelte, canvas-core) together\nso the consistency gate stays green. Frontend package.json.jinja\ntemplates consume the constants via Copier vars, so they flow\nautomatically.\n\n* test: guard canvas-core ag-ui pin against drift\n\nThe consistency gate guarded canvas-vue/canvas-svelte but not\ncanvas-core, which also hardcodes @ag-ui/core and isn''t Copier-rendered\n— so a future core bump could silently skip it. Add canvas-core to the\nparametrization (caught by codex cross-review of this bump).\n\n* test(golden): refresh frontend pins for ag-ui 0.0.57\n\nThe ag-ui bump flows through the vue/svelte frontend package.json.jinja\n(via the ag_ui_*_version Copier vars) into the generated\napps/frontend/package.json, which is byte-pinned in the full_feature and\nfull_feature_max golden snapshots. Regenerate those two entries.","tree":{"sha":"d177a54eb81c2729d04d9168317b3e2fcf31ae74","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/trees/d177a54eb81c2729d04d9168317b3e2fcf31ae74"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cchifor/forge/git/commits/82803bbf4f81bbc4c44ec8ab037cc00a4efb12d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verifi